    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Goal is shining</strong></h2>Try to get your reward from the fridge without getting caught by the Cats. You can see the cheese so clearly that not even a hundred Cats can stop you from getting it!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621080/extras/7b32e147cdd035bb82a2de4c3abd9e8f.poster.avif?t=1739799730\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621080/extras/7b32e147cdd035bb82a2de4c3abd9e8f.webm?t=1739799730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621080/extras/7b32e147cdd035bb82a2de4c3abd9e8f.mp4?t=1739799730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run, little Mouse, Run!</strong></h2>You are small, and the House is so big. But you can be very fast. Run as fast as you can and hide when it's needed. Just don't stop on your epic quest and claim the best reward ever.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621080/extras/4a079c41f07d98781b56f588f8bd33e3.poster.avif?t=1739799730\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621080/extras/4a079c41f07d98781b56f588f8bd33e3.webm?t=1739799730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621080/extras/4a079c41f07d98781b56f588f8bd33e3.mp4?t=1739799730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use your brain</strong></h2>Explore the surroundings to find every possibility to set the cats up and get rid of all of them. Throw, break, chew through, or do whatever you want. It's all for a final great purpose.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621080/extras/7fd4f32d10589ee530f00215b010c5c3.poster.avif?t=1739799730\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621080/extras/7fd4f32d10589ee530f00215b010c5c3.webm?t=1739799730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621080/extras/7fd4f32d10589ee530f00215b010c5c3.mp4?t=1739799730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clean the House</strong></h2>Let people do the dirty work and remove the Cats from the House. No Cats are needed in this beautiful place. This is their true destiny. Nothing personal. It's just business.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621080/extras/6f9e5d29799d954b74bd624a22dd6236.poster.avif?t=1739799730\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621080/extras/6f9e5d29799d954b74bd624a22dd6236.webm?t=1739799730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621080/extras/6f9e5d29799d954b74bd624a22dd6236.mp4?t=1739799730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
